            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “You shall tithe all the yield of your seed, which comes forth from the field year by year. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, in the place which he will choose, to make his name dwell there, you shall eat the tithe of your grain, of your wine, and of your oil, and the firstlings of your herd and flock; that you may learn to fear the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God always. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if the way is too long for you, so that you are not able to bring the tithe, when the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God blesses you, because the place is too far from you, which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God chooses, to set his name there, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then you shall turn it into money, and bind up the money in your hand, and go to the place which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God chooses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and spend the money for whatever you desire, oxen, or sheep, or wine or strong drink, whatever your appetite craves; and you shall eat there before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God and rejoice, you and your household. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall not forsake the Levite who is within your towns, for he has no portion or inheritance with you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
