            "sid": "DEU 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“At the end of every three years you shall bring forth all the tithe of your produce in the same year, and lay it up within your towns; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the Levite, because he has no portion or inheritance with you, and the sojourner, the fatherless, and the widow, who are within your towns, shall come and eat and be filled; that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God may bless you in all the work of your hands that you do.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
